As addition to the discussion of unicode:

---------------------------------------------------------------
encTeX

encTeX is a TeX extension allowing flexible input/output reencoding,
created by Petr Ol=9A=E1k. Among other things, it allows UTF-8 =
processing.
It is TeX-compatible in the sense it passes the TRIP test, with
following changes:

    * the banner is different
    * is has seven more control sequences

encTeX can be downloaded at ftp://math.feld.cvut.cz/pub/olsak/enctex/.
